of stems and sentences. Even so, there is still some sense in
which the rules of a language translate deterministically
from sentences to meanings. OK, I should take a look at Ellis's
book, but if you have the patience then perhaps you might have
another go at explaining. (One of the things I like about
Lojban list is the way it is a confluence of thoughtful people
coming from very different intellectual backgrounds. Very
educational.)

